Some Questions
--------------

Does the Poison Resistance intrinsic make you invulnerable to
cockatrices?  I was bashing cockatrices left and right.  They hit me, I
heard them hiss, but I never even started to turn into stone though I
always kept a couple of lizard corpses handy.

Is gold good for anything besides (1) spending in shops (why lug it
around when you can rob them with a pickaxe) (2) paying your priest your
experience level X 400 (if you can find one)?  Are jewels good for
anything besides throwing at a co-aligned unicorn to increase luck?  In
this game gold and jewels were always the first to go when I got
overweight.  I didn't even pick up jewels.

Why couldn't I write on a blank scroll without ripping it to shreds in
my haste?  Could the magic marker have been cursed early in the game?
Maybe I never thought to check it because it was `original issue.'



